---
import { getSiteForPath } from '../config/site';

const site = getSiteForPath(Astro.url.pathname);

const isChinese = site.isChinese;
---

<section class="governance section">
  <div class="container">
    <hr class="section-divider" />
    <div class="governance-header">
      <span class="section-badge">{isChinese ? '权限和确认' : 'Governance'}</span>
      <h2 class="heading-serif governance-heading">{isChinese ? '重要操作需要先确认。' : "You're the board."}</h2>
      <p class="governance-sub">
        {isChinese ? '涉及权限、预算或关键任务时，可以先由你确认再继续。' : 'Approve hires. Approve strategy. Override anything.'}
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="governance-content">
      <div class="governance-block">
        <p>
          {isChinese
            ? '你可以保留关键流程的最终确认权。未经确认，系统不会自动扩大权限、调整关键策略或继续执行高风险操作。你也可以随时暂停任务、改派执行者和调整预算。'
            : "You operate as the board of directors. Agents cannot hire new agents without your approval. The CEO cannot execute a strategy you have not reviewed. You can pause any agent, reassign any task, and adjust any budget at any time."}
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="governance-block">
        <p class="governance-actions">
          {isChinese ? '暂停、恢复、改派、终止，都可以手动处理。' : 'Pause. Resume. Override. Reassign. Terminate.'}
        </p>
        <p>
          {isChinese
            ? '系统会按规则推进，但关键权限仍由你决定。需要接管时，你可以随时接手。'
            : 'You have full control over every agent in the org. Autonomy is a privilege you grant, not a default.'}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .governance-header {
    padding-top: var(--space-2xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .governance-heading {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .governance-sub {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .governance-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .governance-block p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .governance-actions {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.95rem !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text) !important;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .governance-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
